    {
      "title": "Помощники схемы из letopis/model",
      "text": "`one(…)` и `many(…)` — концы (`End`); `normalizeSchema` приводит JSON Schema к виду, который понимает база; `translatePattern` переводит регулярное выражение в синтаксис jsonpath.",
      "code": "const Shop = hub('Shop', { name: z.string() }, { key: ['name'] });\nreturn {\n  'one(Shop) — End': one(Shop) instanceof End,\n  'normalizeSchema': normalizeSchema({ type: 'object', properties: { n: { type: 'integer', minimum: 1 } } }),\n  'translatePattern': translatePattern('^\\\\d{3}$'),\n};",
      "html": "<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Shop</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> hub</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Shop'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { name: z.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() }, { key: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'name'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'one(Shop) — End'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">one</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Shop) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">instanceof</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> End</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'normalizeSchema'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">normalizeSchema</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'object'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, properties: { n: { type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'integer'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, minimum: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } } }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'translatePattern'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">translatePattern</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'^</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\\</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">d{3}$'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre>",
